    {"id":"file:display/canvas.py","type":"file","name":"canvas.py","filePath":"display/canvas.py","summary":"提供 LandscapeCanvas 類別，封裝橫向 ePaper 畫布的繪圖操作，包含像素轉置、PBM 圖示繪製、局部與全螢幕刷新等低階驅動介面。","tags":["component","utility","service"]},
    {"id":"file:display/fonts.py","type":"file","name":"fonts.py","filePath":"display/fonts.py","summary":"字體載入模組，透過安全動態匯入暴露 FONT_TIME、FONT_BODY、FONT_LABEL 等字體常數供各畫面使用。","tags":["utility","configuration"]},
    {"id":"file:display/icons.py","type":"file","name":"icons.py","filePath":"display/icons.py","summary":"PBM 點陣圖示載入模組，實作 LRU 快取機制從 Flash 讀取 PBM 格式圖示檔，供 ePaper 顯示使用。","tags":["utility","service"]},
