    {"id":"file:display/screens/guide.py","type":"file","name":"guide.py","filePath":"display/screens/guide.py","summary":"Wi-Fi AP 模式引導畫面，顯示熱點 SSID、密碼與設定頁 URL，引導使用者完成初始設定。","tags":["component","utility"]},
